flowchart LR
  SPEC[Model specification] --> DATA[Data and tokenizer research]
  DATA --> TRAIN[Training / post-training future]
  TRAIN --> EVAL[Evaluation and safety review]
  EVAL --> REG[Model registry]
  REG --> ART[Versioned model artifacts]
  ART --> RUN[Runtime]
  RUN --> SERVE[Serving]
  SERVE --> OBS[Monitoring and feedback]
  OBS -. reviewed evidence .-> SPEC
